peer-review.prompt:
Review this change as a peer (do not change files other than the review). Write docs/reviews/platform-review.md.

The request:
{{input.change}}

The plan or diff:
{{state.planSummary}}

Check correctness against the request, blast radius, every destroy or replacement, reversibility, and that the gates pass (quality_gates).

security-review.prompt:
Review the infrastructure change in the workspace for security problems. The request was:
{{input.change}}

The plan or diff:
{{state.planSummary}}

address.prompt:
Address every BLOCKING and MAJOR finding in docs/reviews/platform-review.md and docs/reviews/security-review-iac.md, note under each how it was resolved, and make a new plan or diff exactly as before (planHash and planSummary of the NEW plan).

Peer review: {{state.peer-review}}
Security review: {{state.security-review}}

approve.message:
Approve applying exactly this change ({{input.kind}}, {{input.dir}}; target {{input.target}}). Destroys allowed: {{input.allowDestroy}}.

Plan sha256: {{state.planHash}}

{{state.planSummary}}

Reviews: peer - {{state.peer-review}}; security - {{state.security-review}}

verify.prompt:
Verify the change that was just applied. Check health (k8s rollout-status/get/events, deploy ps, or the resources Terraform changed through their own checks) and run the smoke checks:
{{input.smoke}}

Target: {{input.target}}
What was applied: {{state.apply}}

healthy is true only if everything checked passed.

rollback.prompt:
Verification failed after the change. Roll back now and verify again.
- kubernetes: k8s rollout-undo for every workload the change touched, then rollout-status.
- compose: deploy rollback (or confirm the automatic rollback already happened).
- terraform: do NOT improvise an apply. Report exactly what was applied and what must be reverted; a revert is a new reviewed change.

Target: {{input.target}}
Why verification failed: {{state.verify}}

record.prompt:
Write the change record (docs/changes/<today>-<short-name>.md) as your instructions describe.

Request: {{input.change}}
Kind/where/target: {{input.kind}} {{input.dir}} {{input.target}}
Plan sha256: {{state.planHash}}
Plan or diff:
{{state.planSummary}}
Reviews: peer - {{state.peer-review}}; security - {{state.security-review}}
Gates: {{state.gates}}
Approval: {{state.approve}}
Apply: {{state.apply}}
Verification: {{state.verify}}
Rollback: {{state.rollback}}
